<title>FINLAND: SKOP SAYS SELLS PROPERTY FOR FIM 480 MLN.</title>
<headline>SKOP SAYS SELLS PROPERTY FOR FIM 480 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish bank Yrityspankki Skop Oy said on Wednesday it had sold real estate worth over 480 million markka to the municipal pension insurance fund Kuntien Elakevakuutus.</p>
<p>&quot;When completed, the deal will raise the Skop group's real estate sales from the beginning of the current year to over a billion markka, of which foreign property deals account for about 470 million markka,&quot; Yrityspankki Skop said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
